Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:12.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tyler?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.98,0:01:15.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,I I do
