Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,mine work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:39.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,It sat on top
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:40.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,Most of it ended
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:40.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,up in here
