Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:03.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twenty a bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:07.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mrs Ashford
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:09.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if it
