Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:56.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,the glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:04:57.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,She did
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:04:59.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why kill a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.13,0:05:00.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,you thought was 34?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Why?
