Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's not a single
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:05.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,line on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:07.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,She's 61 and she's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:08.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,gonna live forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:10.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,So you always knew
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:12.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,You just got
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:13.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,tired of waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:15.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tyler Brooks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:16.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,FBI
