Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:19.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,for the attempted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:20.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,murder of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:21.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Vivian Ashford
