Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:26.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tell the U.S
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:27.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Attorney
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:28.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,You were supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:29.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,to be old
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:30.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,I am
